	Nowadays, using AI tools has been a common phenomenon. Opinions vary from person to person. As far as I am concerned, students are supposed to use AI tools within limits.
	On the one hand, if students over-rely on AI tools to finish their school tasks, they may gradually lose the ability of considering and handling problems independently. AI tools
